    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The woodblessed empowers themself or their next attack."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If the woodblessed's next action is to Stride, is launched off the ground by a suddenly sprouting tree and propelled forward. During this Stride, they have a fly Speed equal to their Speed. If they don't end their movement on a solid surface that can support their weight, they fall."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If the woodblessed's next action is a Strike, the attack sprouts thorns that deal an additional 1d4 persistent bleed damage (1d6 for levels 6–12, 1d10 for levels 13+)."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
